#: ../../getting_started/guides/azure_guide.rst:407
msgid ""
"Provisionable elements in |morpheus| combine a Node Type(s), Layout(s), "
"and an Instance Type. The `Overview section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/provisioning/library/library.html#overview>`_"
" of |morpheus| docs discusses these objects and how they work together in"
" greater detail. Our first step here will be to create a Node Type which "
"wrap the image itself with additional configuration, templates, and "
"scripts. While not strictly required, creating the Node Type, Instance "
"Type, and then the Layout is often a good workflow for creating Library "
"items. That is the order we will follow in this guide."
msgstr ""
"Provisionable elements in |morpheus| combine a Node Type(s), Layout(s), y"
" an Instance Type. The `Overview section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/provisioning/library/library.html#overview>`_"
" of |morpheus| docs discusses these objects y how they work together in "
"greater detail. Our first step here será to create a Node Type which wrap"
" the image itself con additional configuration, templates, y scripts. "
"While not strictly required, creating the Node Type, Instance Type, y "
"then the Layout is often a good workflow for creating Library items. That"
" is the order we will follow in this guide."

